abstract: >
  This version of PCR-GLOBWB2 was developed as part of my TU
  Delft Masters' thesis project to model the Aral Sea.


  The original PCR-GLOBWB model and its documentation remain
  the reference for the underlying model methodology. This
  repository documents the modifications and adaptations
  made for this version of the model in order for my
  research and for possible ewatercycle integration.
